OL,3,AGCSE grade gap between boys and girls
OL,4,Anarrows as thousands of students get
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of students have
OL,8,Fopened their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,9,FNationals results in England, Wales and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland
OL,12,FThe overall pass rate has fallen
OL,13,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,14,Fbut top grades have edged up across all
OL,15,Fthree nations, as the gap between the
OL,16,Fpass rates for boys and girls has
OL,17,Fnarrowed to its lowest point since 2000
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
