OL,3,AGCSE grade gap between boys and girls
OL,4,Anarrows as thousands of students get
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FQuadruplets Rose, Ellen, Layla and Eric
OL,8,Fhappily collected their GCSE results
OL,9,Ftogether, but are also pleased for a
OL,10,F"break" from each other as they go to
OL,11,Fseparate colleges
OL,13,FNot everyone getting their results is a
OL,14,Fteenager, with nurse Joanne, 56, "over
OL,15,Fthe moon" after passing her maths exam,
OL,16,Fand 20-year-old Nasser, who's fled the
OL,17,Fwar in Sudan, saying passing his maths
OL,18,Fand English GCSEs is one of his
OL,19,F"proudest moments"
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
