OL,3,AGCSE grade gap between boys and girls
OL,4,Anarrows as thousands of students get
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn England, GCSEs are graded using a
OL,8,Fnumerical system from 9-1, while in
OL,9,FWales and Northern Ireland they are
OL,10,Fstill graded using letters from A* to U
OL,12,FOur team of experts have been answering
OL,13,Fyour questions - giving advice on
OL,14,Fthings like getting your paper remarked
OL,15,Fand if you don't have a plan yet
